{
  "_comment": [
    "User additions to the Quickshell SettingsMenu. Activate by renaming",
    "this file to menu.json (no `.sample`) in this same directory.",
    "",
    "Each entry is merged into the menu tree at the same id. To add a",
    "child, list it in the parent's `children`. To override an existing",
    "entry, repeat its id with new fields.",
    "",
    "Action shapes:",
    "  { \"type\": \"ipc\",         \"target\": \"<dialog-id>\" }",
    "  { \"type\": \"tui\",         \"name\":   \"<short>\",  \"exec\": [\"cmd\", \"args\"] }",
    "  { \"type\": \"shell\",       \"cmd\":    \"sh-string\" }",
    "  { \"type\": \"exec\",        \"cmd\":    [\"binary\", \"args\"] }",
    "  { \"type\": \"exec-in-foot\",\"appId\":  \"tui-X\",   \"cmd\": [\"binary\", \"args\"] }",
    "  { \"type\": \"quickshell-spawn\", \"path\": \"$HOME/.config/quickshell/lock/shell.qml\" }",
    "",
    "labelKey points at an i18n string (see config/quickshell/i18n/);",
    "if you don't add a key, use `label` for an inline literal instead."
  ],

  "setup": {
    "children": ["setup.audio", "setup.bluetooth", "setup.wifi",
                 "setup.browser", "setup.language", "setup.notes"]
  },
  "setup.notes": {
    "icon":  "󰠮",
    "label": "Notes",
    "action": { "type": "exec-in-foot", "appId": "tui-notes", "cmd": ["nvim", "~/notes.md"] }
  }
}
